All five corrections for Round r5 are implemented across the allowlisted files.

The heart luminance test now evaluates the full canvas rather than a fixed central crop, eliminating phase sensitivity at arbitrary checkpoints. Quad fill strings are precomputed into a 2,048-entry cached color table so runtime frames execute only bitwise integer indexing and direct array lookups, unused vertex rotation arrays were removed, spark sizes span 1.5 to 3 px, and the burst test advances in 2 s increments.

