2. Cached color table with 32 intensity buckets, 8 rim levels, and 8 specular levels avoids runtime string allocations in [public/color-polish/scenes/peace-in-practice.js](file:///Users/anthony/.claude/worktrees/mothers-love-tv-peace-in-practice/public/color-polish/scenes/peace-in-practice.js).
